## Models

- **hybrid**: resolver=dguzh/geo-all-MiniLM-L6-v2
- **trim**: resolver=dguzh/geo-all-MiniLM-L6-v2
- **population**: resolver=dguzh/geo-all-MiniLM-L6-v2
